    '55': DlogAlarmReference(machine: 'trima', code: '55', name: 'DISCONNECT TEST MSS ALARM', statusLine: 'Donor disconnect verification error', messageType: 'R1', dlogText: 'Disconnect donor (Automated Solutions Pending) - Disconnect could not be confirmed!', category: '', alarmId: '', occursDuring: 'Donor Disconnect', detection: 'If the donor disconnect test fails 3 times, the machine will generate this alarm and wait for operator confirmation to unload the cassette.', possibleCauses: 'l Donor line clamp is not closed. l Negative pressure in access line exceeds access low alarm limit before -100 mmHg change occurs. Vent negative pressure and try test again. l Defective APS. l Defective APS/CPS Adapter CCA. l Defective I/O Two CCA l Defective Control CCA.', suggestedActions: 'Verify functionality of APS sensor by applying a known pressure and'),
