    '78': DlogAlarmReference(machine: 'trima', code: '78', name: 'LOW PLATELET CONCENTRATION ALERT', statusLine: 'Low platelet concentration detected', messageType: 'R1', dlogText: 'Low platelet concentration detected', category: '', alarmId: '', occursDuring: 'Blood Run', detection: 'When the system has calculated that a yield of 1.0 E11 should have been achieved, it checks the RBC detector calculation of current yield. If the RBC detector yield is less than 54% of the predicted yield, the machine generates this alert.', possibleCauses: 'l Air block in plasma line. l Inaccurate platelet precount. l Excessive pasting in the channel. l Defective RBC detector. l Defective RBC Detector CCA.', suggestedActions: 'Run the RBC/Set Detector and RBC Detector Ratio test in Autotest.'),
