    '107': DlogAlarmReference(machine: 'trima', code: '107', name: 'POWER TEST FAILURE', statusLine: 'Power test failure', messageType: 'R1', dlogText: 'Power test Failure', category: '', alarmId: '', occursDuring: 'Startup Tests', detection: 'During the power up, the machine will test the 24 V and 64 V power supplies. Alarm is raised if: The pumps move more than 0.1 ml just after 24 V power reaches 18v Or: If pumps move 0.5 seconds after last check Or: If Safety fails power test because it could not reach nominal 24 V and/or 64 V power within 30 seconds of switching on Or: If Control sees 24 V and/or 64 V power outside the 85% nominal voltage.', possibleCauses: 'l Defective power supply. l Loose connector between the power supply and the Control CCA. l Shorted 24 V or 64 V component or wire. l Defective 64 V Switch. l Defective Centrifuge Motor Controller. l Defective Control CCA.', suggestedActions: 'l Run the Voltage test in Autotest.'),
