    '1221': DlogAlarmReference(machine: 'reveos', code: '1221', name: 'Hydraulic pressure too high', statusLine: '', messageType: '', dlogText: '', category: 'Procedure', alarmId: 'Bucket3HydOverPressureAlarm', occursDuring: 'Processing of that bucket.', detection: 'This alarm is raised when the hydraulic pressure sensor indicates the hydraulic pressure is 2.5 bar or greater.', possibleCauses: 'One of the bucket lines is kinked. Check the lines in the bucket for kinks. The frangible is unbroken or partially broken. Ensure that the frangible is properly broken. The hydraulic system contains too much air. Purge air from the hydraulic system. The hydraulic pressure sensor connector is loose. Troubleshoot the hydraulic system for air and fluid leaks. The hydraulic pressure sensor is defective. Confirm the pressure sensor connector is secure. Compare hydraulic pressure sensor readings to a calibrated gauge. Replace the sensor if it is defective.', suggestedActions: ''),
