    '1525': DlogAlarmReference(machine: 'reveos', code: '1525', name: 'Problem closing valve', statusLine: '', messageType: '', dlogText: '', category: 'Valve', alarmId: 'Bucket2PlasmaValveCloseFailureAlarm', occursDuring: 'When valve closes.', detection: 'This alarm is raised when the plasma valve failed to close before the maximum time-out limits.', possibleCauses: 'A valve is stuck in the closed position. If the valve is stuck unjam the valve. Refer to the e-rotor troubleshooting section. The e-rotor is defective. The problem may not appear unless the conditions under which the alarm occurred are replicated. If the problem is only with one valve, the source most likely exists within the e-rotor. Problems that affect all valves may be a failure external to the e-rotor. Refer to the e-rotor troubleshooting section. The connections between the e-box and the e-rotor are defective. Check the connections between e-rotor and e-box. The e-box or its connections are defective. Troubleshoot the e-box and replace if defective. The system power supply voltages are out of range. Confirm system power supply voltages are in range under load. The slip ring is faulty. Test the slip ring in different positions to check for proper brush contact a full 360° of rotation. An e-rotor component may have failed. To determine the occurrence rate of failure, perform a RAT search on the log files; set the search parameters for one month at minimum. Longer is preferable. Replace the e-rotor only when the problem becomes frequent.', suggestedActions: ''),
